      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is old and probably just do to the old recommended capacity (soft-cap) of the world. Back then, when instances had half the world's capacity they wouldn't show up on the instance list. I don't know what the world's capacity was in the Black Cat world back then though. Not to mention the whole main menu has changed since this was posted.\n\nRight now the [Black Cat](https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_4cf554b4-430c-4f8f-b53e-1f294eed230b) world has a capacity of 80 and a recommended capacity of 24. And there are many public instances visible.\n\nSo I assume this canny post can be closed.",
